Learned scorer weights
----------------------
The default crop scorer ships trained weights (src/learned-weights.ts, bundled
in dist/). They were trained on human crop ratings and annotations from these
public research datasets:

  - GAICD (Grid Anchor based Image Cropping Dataset), Zeng et al.
  - FCDB (Flickr Cropping Dataset), Chen et al.

The weights contain no images from these datasets. The datasets' own licence
terms are not stated by their authors. If that matters for your use, check the
dataset terms yourself, or use the original algorithm instead:
smartcrop.crop(image, { ...smartcrop.PRESETS.classic, width, height }).
